  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Research Program &#x2013; Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Research Program aims to inform evidence based policy making and program design by the Australian Government, and Pacific partner governments and organisations. The PRP does this by: undertaking high quality research and analysis; communicating findings and public policy implications to a broad set of stakeholders; developing the capabilities of Pacific researchers; and maintaining and deepening connections between Pacific and Australian researchers and academics.</narrative>
  </description>
